{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JDG","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"士師記","commonName":"士師記","title":"士師記","order":7,"numberOfChapters":21,"sha256":"6ed3d1cf3bce165264d09e27218a36f1292a6df9ad9d40d1399c8dc8fc4e8900","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JDG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":21,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JDG/21.json","totalNumberOfVerses":617},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米迦的偶像"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以法蓮山地有一個人名叫米迦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他對母親說：「你那一千一百舍客勒銀子被人拿去，你因此咒詛，並且告訴了我。看哪，這銀子在我這裏，是我拿去了。」他母親說：「我兒啊，願耶和華賜福與你！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["米迦就把這一千一百舍客勒銀子還他母親。他母親說：「我分出這銀子來為你獻給耶和華，好雕刻一個像，鑄成一個像。現在我還是交給你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["米迦將銀子還他母親，他母親將二百舍客勒銀子交給銀匠，雕刻一個像，鑄成一個像，安置在米迦的屋內。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["這米迦有了神堂，又製造以弗得和家中的神像，分派他一個兒子作祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那時以色列中沒有王，各人任意而行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["猶大的伯利恆有一個少年人，是猶大族的利未人，他在那裏寄居。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["這人離開猶大的伯利恆城，要找一個可住的地方。行路的時候，到了以法蓮山地，走到米迦的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["米迦問他說：「你從哪裏來？」他回答說：「從猶大的伯利恆來。我是利未人，要找一個可住的地方。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["米迦說：「你可以住在我這裏，我以你為父、為祭司。我每年給你十舍客勒銀子，一套衣服和度日的食物。」利未人就進了他的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["利未人情願與那人同住；那人看這少年人如自己的兒子一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["米迦分派這少年的利未人作祭司，他就住在米迦的家裏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["米迦說：「現在我知道耶和華必賜福與我，因我有一個利未人作祭司。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JDG/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JDG/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JDG/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}